{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "label": "ADR 0015: A durable series stores what Jira forgets, and re-derivation is a labelled fallback", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_durable_sprint_series", "label": "A sprint's row is written once when it closes and read thereafter", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The question asked of every field: if we throw this away, can Jira tell us again? A cache of an authoritative system is a second copy waiting to disagree, so the store holds only what cannot be recovered, with the observation date and the status configuration it was computed under. Lifting the six-sprint cap first was deferred behind the store."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_four_irrecoverables", "label": "The four things Jira cannot tell us again", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A published forecast; anything about a deleted issue; committedItems after sprint membership is stripped (predictability reconstructs as better than it was); and any figure whose meaning depends on the status categorisation in force at the time (started moves retroactively when a status is recategorised). Invocation cost is a fifth reason, labelled as an argument for caching, not recording."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_re_derivation_labelled_fallback", "label": "Re-derivation is a labelled fallback, and disagreements are said aloud", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A reconstructed row has a different warrant, not a worse one; recording a reconstruction as if observed would launder that warrant. Where a recorded row and a reconstruction disagree, say so \u2014 it is the only signal a status was recategorised under a year of history."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_counts_never_issue_text", "label": "The store holds counts, never issue text", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nine numbers, a sprint name and two provenance fields. Reuses storage:app already granted for ADR 0014, and keeps item 4 from waiting on item 5's permission model: nothing in the store is an issue anyone could be denied sight of."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_wip_reconstructs_fine", "label": "First answer, corrected: wipItems re-derives correctly", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "history_row() counts in-progress from started/resolved dates that do not move, so the original premise (wipItems is irrecoverable) was false after 1.36.0 and the record was rewritten on the narrower, true case."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "target": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_durable_sprint_series", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "target": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_four_irrecoverables", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "target": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_re_derivation_labelled_fallback", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "target": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_counts_never_issue_text", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "target": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_wip_reconstructs_fine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_four_irrecoverables", "target": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_durable_sprint_series", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_wip_reconstructs_fine", "target": "agent_tools_metrics_history_row", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_four_irrecoverables", "target": "agent_tools_forecast_score_calibration", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "target": "docs_adr_0014_jira_sends_the_brief_and_the_read_only_rule_bends", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "target": "claude", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets", "target": "readme", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0015_a_durable_series_stores_what_jira_forgets_re_derivation_labelled_fallback", "target": "docs_adr_0007_refuse_rather_than_widen_refuse_rather_than_widen", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/adr/0015-a-durable-series-stores-what-jira-forgets.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}